    faq: [
      { q: "What is the best mutation in Steal an Egg?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>Rainbow mutation is the best mutation, with a x3.5 multiplier.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "How do you get Silver, Golden, and Rainbow mutations?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>These mutations can appear when an egg hatches and can also be obtained during Admin Abuse events.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "How do you get Bloom and Spirit Bloom?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>Both mutations are obtained through the Sakura Incubator.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "How do you get a Parasite mutation?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>You need to obtain and hatch a Parasite Egg, which can drop from Hungry Frog during the Hungry Frog event.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "How do you get the Fractured mutation?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>Fractured can be obtained by using mutation consumables from the Rift Boss event or Boss mastery rewards.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "How do you get the Srambled mutation?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>Defeat Dr. Scramble's drones, collect Samples, and use them to buy Scrambled Mutation consumables from the Experiment Shop.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "Can you fuse pets with mutations?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>Yes. Fusing three pets with the same mutation keeps that mutation on the resulting pet. The resulting pet can also become larger, potentially increasing its income.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "How do you get the Nitro mutation in Steal an Egg?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>You can obtain Nitro mutation consumables from the Nitro Race event shop using Trophies. Each consumable has a 10% chance to apply the Nitro mutation.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "How do you get the Spectral mutation in Steal an Egg?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>Board the Phantom Express using your Phantom Express Ticket and enter the new area. Use the ghost-vacuum, collect Souls, then exchange them at the Soul Extractor for a Spectral Mutation consumable. The mutation has a reported 25% application chance and provides a 2.75x income multiplier.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "How do you get the Abducted mutation in Steal an Egg?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>To get the Abducted mutation in Steal an Egg, participate in the UFO event by finding Suspicious Eggs and delivering them to the Alien Ship to collect UFO Debris. Once you have 500 UFO Debris, exchange it with Paranoid Pete for an Alien Mutation crystal, which has a 15% chance of applying the Abducted mutation to an egg.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
    ],
