    faq: [
      { q: "Where is 2026 Worlds League of Legends?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>LoL Worlds 2026 takes place in the United States across three venues: Riot Games Arena in Los Angeles (play-ins), Credit Union of Texas Event Center in Allen (Swiss, quarterfinals, and semifinals), and Barclays Center in Brooklyn, New York (finals).</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "What date is Worlds 2026?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>Worlds 2026 runs from October 15 to November 14. Play-ins take place October 15–18, Swiss October 23–31, knockouts November 3–8, and the final on November 14.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "Is T1 qualified for Worlds 2026?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>Yes, T1 qualified as South Korea's third seed, advancing directly to the Swiss stage.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "Who is in LoL Worlds 2026?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>A total of 19 teams qualified for Worlds 2026 from six regional leagues: Gen.G, HLE, T1, DK, AL, BLG, TES, IG, TLAW, C9, LYON, KC, G2, MKOI, TSW, CFO, MVK, LOS, and FUR.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "Where will LoL Worlds 2027 be held?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>Riot Games confirmed that LoL Worlds 2027 will take place in South Korea, returning for the first time since 2023. However, Riot hasn't officially confirmed the host city and venue yet.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "Is Worlds LoL every year?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>Yes, the League of Legends World Championship has been held annually since 2011.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "How much are League of Legends Worlds tickets 2026?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>Resale prices for League of Legends World Championship finals tickets can reach $6,000, while Swiss stage tickets start around $40. Prices depend on stage and seating.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "How to qualify for LoL Worlds 2026?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>Teams qualify through their regional leagues based on domestic results, championship points, or regional qualifiers. MSI results also influence regional allocations.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "How to get Worlds LoL tickets?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>League of Legends Worlds 2026 tickets were originally available through Ticketmaster, as Riot's Fan First presale for verified players. Those sales have ended, but you can still browse resale marketplaces.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
    ],
