    faq: [
      { q: "How much money is 32 000 RP in LoL?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>There’s no 32 000 RP bundle in LoL. The closest deal is the 33 500 RP bundle, which costs 244.99 € in EUW or 244.99 $ in NA.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "How to win RP in LoL?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>You can’t win RP by playing LoL matches. LoL RP can be purchased or redeemed from gift cards/with codes. </p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "Can you get free LoL RP?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>Yes, but it’s hard to get free RP for League. You can use the Microsoft Rewards program, watch for streamer giveaways, or exchange art for a small amount of RP by submitting a ticket to Riot.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "Can I transfer RP to another LoL account?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>No. Riot doesn’t let you transfer RP already on your account.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "Do Riot Points expire in League of Legends?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>No, League RP doesn’t expire, but account termination removes access to the remaining RP.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "Can you refund unused League of Legends RP?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>Yes. Riot allows refunds within 14 days if you haven't spent any of the purchased RP.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "Can you buy the exact amount of RP you need in League?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>No. Riot sells RP in fixed bundles. But if you’re just a few RP short, you can exchange art for it.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "Does RP transfer when you change LoL servers?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>Yes. When transferring your League account, the remaining RP moves to the new server after the 2 600-RP transfer cost.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "Is RP shared between League of Legends and Teamfight Tactics?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>On PC and Mac, yes. TFT Mobile uses separate mobile-store currency instead.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "Can you convert RP to Blue Essence?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>No. RP and Blue Essence are separate currencies with different acquisition methods. But you can sometimes get BE by purchasing things like Hextech chests with RP.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "How much RP do League of Legends skins cost?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>Champion skins in League can cost anywhere from as low as 200 RP to over 3 000 RP.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
    ],
