    faq: [
      { q: "How many weapons are in MM2?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>Murder Mystery 2 currently has over 1000 weapons, split across knives and guns. These weapons are grouped into eight rarity categories: Common, Uncommon, Rare, Legendary, Godly, Ancient, Unique, and Vintage.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "Are Godly weapons the best weapons in MM2?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>Yes, Godly Chromas are the most valuable weapons in MM2 due to their effects, animated textures, and low unboxing rates.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "What is the top weapon rarity in MM2?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>By category, Unique weapons sit at the top of MM2 rarity. Many Unique weapons are only awarded to players who place on limited-time event leaderboards, making them extremely difficult to obtain. But Uniques aren’t the most valuable in the trading economy.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "How do you get weapons in MM2?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>MM2 weapons can be obtained through Mystery Boxes, Knife Boxes, Gun Boxes, crafting, event rewards, gamepasses, promo codes, trading, and limited-time leaderboards. Some older weapons are no longer directly obtainable and can only be acquired through trading.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "Can you still get old MM2 event weapons?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>Many older MM2 event weapons are no longer obtainable through their original events. These items can only be acquired through trading with other players.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "What are Chroma weapons in MM2?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>Chroma weapons are special Godly variants known for their animated color-changing effects. They are the most valuable items in MM2.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "Are Ancient weapons better than Godly weapons?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>Not necessarily. Ancient weapons rank above Godly weapons in MM2 rarity and often drop from major holiday events such as Halloween or Christmas. That said, it still depends on the specific weapon, not just the rarity label.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "What is the most valuable MM2 weapon?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>Nik’s Scythe is the most valuable weapon in MM2, but only 7 people have it. The most valuable tradeable weapon is Chroma Traveler’s Gun.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
      { q: "Can you buy MM2 weapons safely?", aHtml: "<div class=\"entry\">\n                                            <p>Yes, players who do not want to grind or trade for weeks can buy MM2 items through a secure marketplace. Eldorado.gg offers verified sellers, buyer protection, payment security until delivery confirmation, reviews, and 24/7 support.</p>\n                                        </div>" },
    ],
